{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54682","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 二十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日旁晕，状若死蛇围。\n其兆主（京本作「生」）灾先举（京本作「损」）将，师徒半出不能回，宜改（京本作「後」）拥师归。\n（此首首本缺，据辛本、川本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}